; ArcLibre 2026: historical ShareD spellings for the published ShareFS SWIs.
; The chunk is already supplied by the pinned public allocation header.
; CreateShare and StopShare are offsets 0 and 1; see desktop-startup patch notes.
; This declares the interface only. No sharing runtime is supplied.
ShareD_CreateShare * ShareDSWI_Base
ShareD_StopShare   * ShareDSWI_Base+1
XShareD_CreateShare * Auto_Error_SWI_bit+ShareD_CreateShare
XShareD_StopShare   * Auto_Error_SWI_bit+ShareD_StopShare
        END
